        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 440, Sunflower Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cheery door knob is sure to brighten up any home. From the sunflower in the knob to the stitching along the rose handle, every detail will add a charming rural accent to any decor. Available in polished brass and shaded bronze. Easy to install, the 417 Omnia Knobset will fit 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" or 2\" door thicknesses with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll critical interior parts are made of brass. Tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout. All dimensions are standard to fit existing bores for easy replacement installations.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Floral Knob With Ribbon and Reed Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 440 Sunflower Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> for the Omnia 440/00 Embellished Solid Brass Sunflower Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door by using a 7mm solid spindle. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Uses 7mm split spindle. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sunflower Knobset, Omnia 440/00",
                "description": "Omnia 440/00 Sunflower Knob - This cheery door knob is sure to brighten up any home. From the sunflower in the knob to the stitching along the rose handle, every detail will add a charming rural accent to any decor. Available in polished brass and shaded bronze. Easy to install, the 417 Omnia Knobset will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. ",
                "keywords": "Omnia 440/00 Sunflower Door Knobsets, OMN-440/00, Sunflower door knobs, Solid brass door knobs, ornate doorknobs, embellished knobsets, Omnia Sunflower door latchsets, Omnia 440 solid brass door knobs, Omnia Sunflower doorknob latchsets, omnia floral knobs, Floral Door Knobsets, Ornate Floral Knobsets, floral knobs, omnia 440 floral knobs, 440 omnia Sunflower knobs, ribbon and reed knobs, flowers,"
